abstract: "ThoxWork is the third THOX platform: the work-organization layer in which a company assigns real work to named DigitalHuman colleagues (ThoxEmployees), reaches them through Rolodex, bounds their authority and resources by MeshGroup, and draws on approved capacity through MeshStack. This comprehensive edition defines the model formally, audits the code built toward it, evaluates the model invariants in a deterministic virtual lab, measures the rules against the product code, and replays the full evaluation against the live implementation. Results are labelled SIMULATED or MEASURED throughout."
keywords:
